OL,3,GNEWSAPregnancy stereotypes challenged
OL,4,Ain new film
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn actor says she was able to draw on
OL,7,Fher own pregnancy while writing and
OL,8,Fstarring in a movie about a woman
OL,9,Ftaking the plunge and dating during her
OL,10,Fthird trimester.
OL,12,FJade Asha, 36, from Billericay, Essex,
OL,13,Fwho has been acting for more than 20
OL,14,Fyears, pitched the idea for Due Dating
OL,15,Fin the early stages of her own
OL,16,Fpregnancy and then spent three months
OL,17,Fwriting the screenplay.
OL,19,FThe film, which premieres in London
OL,20,Fnext month, is described as a "bold and
OL,21,Fthought-provoking romantic comedy
OL,22,Fdrama".
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
